      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1 5252                                                  (East Side)                                                  No 92 TL 0508 3/203 II                       GV 2. Early to mid C19.  Colour washed brick, Welsh slated roof.  2 storeys, 2 flush windows with glazing bars under cambered arches, ground floor sashes, 1st floor casements.  Cut bracketted gabled doorhood.  Included for group value. Nos 92 to 96 (even) and No 104 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0529008912"
    }
